"With You" debuted at number 72 on the [[Billboard Hot 100|''Billboard'' Hot 100]] in the issue dated December 15, 2007, earning the biggest debut title for the week.<ref>{{cite magazine|title=Hot 100 (December 15, 2007)|url=http://acharts.us/us_singles_top_100/2007/50|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=[[Prometheus Global Media]]|access-date=July 5, 2012}}</ref> In the song's seventh week, it entered the top ten tier of the chart, ascending from number twelve in the previous week to number six.<ref>{{cite magazine|title=Hot 100 (January 26, 2008)|url=http://www.billboard.com/charts/2008-01-26/hot-100|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=[[Prometheus Global Media]]|access-date=July 3, 2012}}</ref> Three weeks later, in the issue dated February 16, 2008, "With You" peaked at number two the Billboard Hot 100, where it remained for four consecutive weeks.<ref>Sources for "With You" positions on the US [[Billboard Hot 100|''Billboard'' Hot 100]]:
* Week of February 16, 2008: {{cite magazine|url=http://www.billboard.com/charts/2008-02-16/hot-100|title= Hot 100 (February 16, 2008)|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=[[Prometheus Global Media]]|access-date=July 3, 2012}}
* Week of February 23, 2008: {{cite magazine|url=http://www.billboard.com/charts/2008-02-23/hot-100|title= Hot 100 (February 23, 2008)|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=[[Prometheus Global Media]]|access-date=July 3, 2012}}
* Week of March 1, 2008: {{cite magazine|url=http://www.billboard.com/charts/2008-03-01/hot-100|title= Hot 100 (March 1, 2008)|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=[[Prometheus Global Media]]|access-date=July 3, 2012}}
* Week of March 8, 2008: {{cite magazine|url=http://www.billboard.com/charts/2008-03-08/hot-100|title= Hot 100 (March 8, 2008)|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=[[Prometheus Global Media]]|access-date=July 3, 2012}}
</ref> On March 15, 2008, the song fell to number three, but ascended to number two the succeeding week, where it remained for another week, this time blocked by Usher's "[[Love in This Club]]" featuring Young Jeezy.<ref>Sources for "With You" positions on the US [[Billboard Hot 100|''Billboard'' Hot 100]]:
* Week of March 22, 2008: {{cite magazine|url=http://www.billboard.com/charts/2008-03-22/hot-100|title= Hot 100 (March 22, 2008)|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=[[Prometheus Global Media]]|access-date=July 3, 2012}}
* Week of March 29, 2008: {{cite magazine|url=http://www.billboard.com/charts/2008-03-29/hot-100|title= Hot 100 (March 29, 2008)|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=[[Prometheus Global Media]]|access-date=July 3, 2012}}
</ref> The song also topped the US [[Radio Songs (chart)|Radio Songs]] and the US [[Pop Songs]] charts as well as peaking at number five on the US Hot R&B/Hip-Hop Songs chart. It was certified platinum on April 24, 2008, by the [[Recording Industry Association of America]] (RIAA) for selling one million downloads.<ref name=riaa>{{cite web|title=American single certifications - Chris Brown feat. T-Pain - Kiss Kiss|url=http://riaa.com/goldandplatinumdata.php?artist=%22With+You%22|publisher=[[Recording Industry Association of America]] (RIAA)|access-date=July 3, 2012}}</ref> In Canada, "With You" entered the [[Canadian Hot 100]] as the chart's highest debut at number 70 in the issue dated January 5, 2008.<ref>{{cite magazine|title=Canadian Hot 100 (November 3, 2007)|url=http://acharts.us/canada_singles_top_100/2008/01|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=acharts.us|access-date=July 3, 2012}}</ref> Ten weeks later, the song peaked at number two, where it remained for two weeks.<ref>{{cite magazine|title=Canadian Hot 100 (March 22, 2008)|url=http://www.billboard.com/charts/2008-03-22/canadian-hot-100|magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]]|publisher=[[Prometheus Global Media]]|access-date=July 3, 2012}}</ref> On March 26, 2008, it was certified gold by [[Music Canada]] for selling 20,000 ringtones.<ref name=cria>{{cite web|title=Canadian single certifications - Chris Brown - With You|url=http://www.musiccanada.com/GPSearchResult.aspx?st=With%20You&ica=False&sa=Chris%20Brown&sl=&smt=0&sat=-1&ssb=Artist|publisher=[[Music Canada]]|access-date=July 3, 2012}}{{Dead link|date=December 2025 |bot=InternetArchiveBot }}</ref>

"With You" debuted on the [[Australian Singles Chart]] at number 24 on the issue dated March 16, 2008.<ref name="Australia"/> The song quickly ascended the chart, reaching its peak at number five in its fifth week, where it remained for two weeks.<ref name="Australia"/> "Kiss Kiss" was later certified double platinum by the [[Australian Recording Industry Association]] (ARIA) for shipping 140,000 copies.<ref name=aria>{{cite web|url=http://www.aria.com.au/pages/httpwww.aria.com.aupageshttpwww.aria.com.aupagesARIACharts-Accreditations-2008Singles.htm|title=ARIA Charts — Accreditations — 2008 Singles|publisher=[[Australian Recording Industry Association]] (ARIA)|access-date=April 14, 2009}}</ref> In New Zealand, the song entered the singles chart at number 25 on the issue dated December 17, 2007.<ref name="New Zealand"/> Three weeks later, the song entered the top five, ascending to number four.<ref name="New Zealand"/> In the issue dated February 18, 2008, "With You" topped the [[New Zealand Singles Chart|New Zealand Top 40]], where it remained for four weeks.<ref name="New Zealand"/> It remained on the chart for a total of twenty-three weeks.<ref name="New Zealand"/> The song was certified platinum on March 16, 2008, by the [[Recording Industry Association of New Zealand]] (RIANZ).<ref name=rianz>{{cite web|url=http://www.radioscope.net.nz/index.php?option=com_content&task=view&id=77&Itemid=61 |title=Latest Gold/Platinum Singles |publisher=[[Recording Industry Association of New Zealand]] (RIANZ). RadioScope |access-date=April 14, 2009 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20110724195845/http://www.radioscope.net.nz/index.php?option=com_content&task=view&id=77&Itemid=61 |archive-date=July 24, 2011 }}</ref> "With You" debuted on the [[UK Singles Chart]] at number 100 in the issue dated February 2, 2008.<ref name="United Kingdom"/> It eventually peaked at number eight on the week ending April 5, 2008, and remained on the singles chart for a total of thirty-six weeks.<ref name="United Kingdom"/> On August 22, 2008, "With You" was certified silver by the [[British Phonographic Industry]] (BPI) for selling 200,000 copies.<ref name="BPIcert">{{cite web|url=http://www.bpi.co.uk/certifiedawards/search.aspx|title=Certified Awards Search: Chris Brown|publisher=[[British Phonographic Industry]]|access-date=December 15, 2010|archive-date=June 30, 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170630225416/http://www.bpi.co.uk/certifiedawards/search.aspx|url-status=dead}} Note: enter "With You" into the 'Search' box and select "Title" from the 'Search by' menu.</ref>

